{"synopsis":"\\[Dari Studio yang mengerjakan \\<Solo Farming In The Tower>]\n\nDi penghujung hari yang melelahkan, rasa sakit tiba-tiba menyerang... dan aku mendapati diriku berpindah ke dalam novel fantasi \"Dark Header!\"\n\nNamun, dari semua orang… aku menjadi Pangeran Ketujuh yang bejat, yang ditakdirkan untuk dieksekusi dengan menyedihkan tiga tahun kemudian?!\n\nMulai saat ini, hanya ada satu tujuan: bersembunyi sampai protagonis asli muncul, lalu diam-diam melarikan diri dari kekaisaran.\n\nNamun, peristiwa dalam cerita asli mulai terjadi jauh lebih cepat dari yang diperkirakan. Saat aku bergerak di antara istana kekaisaran dan daerah kumuh… upaya rahasia untuk mengatasi dampaknya pun dimulai.","alternative_title":"7황자는 애매해서 탈출합니다","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Studio 389","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ch_15","number":"15","chapter":"15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_14","number":"14","chapter":"14","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_13","number":"13","chapter":"13","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_12","number":"12","chapter":"12","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_11","number":"11","chapter":"11","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_10","number":"10","chapter":"10","title":"Chapter 10","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_9","number":"9","chapter":"9","title":"Chapter 9","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_8","number":"8","chapter":"8","title":"Chapter 8","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_7","number":"7","chapter":"7","title":"Chapter 7","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_6","number":"6","chapter":"6",